sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Receptionist
    participant AP as Staff Panel
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over R,DB: Login
    R->>AP: Enter credentials
    AP->>BE: POST /api/receptionist/login
    BE->>DB: Validate receptionist
    BE-->>AP: JWT token (rtoken)

    Note over R,DB: Check Patient Attendance
    R->>AP: Search patient appointment
    AP->>BE: GET /api/receptionist/appointments
    BE->>DB: Fetch today's queue
    R->>AP: Check in patient
    AP->>BE: POST /api/receptionist/check-in
    BE->>DB: Status → Checked In

    Note over R,DB: Check Appointment Status
    R->>AP: Update to In Progress / Finished
    AP->>BE: POST /api/receptionist/appointment-status
    BE->>DB: Update appointmentStatus

    Note over R,DB: Check Payment Status
    R->>AP: View unpaid visits
    AP->>BE: GET /api/receptionist/appointments
    BE-->>AP: Payment status list

    Note over R,DB: Process Payment
    R->>AP: Select Cash or Visa
    AP->>BE: POST /api/receptionist/payment
    BE->>DB: paymentStatus → Paid
    BE-->>AP: Payment recorded
